# SBPL label template for BIB NFC labels — SATO CL4NX Plus 203dpi
#
# HOW TO UPDATE THIS FILE:
#   1. Capture a real SBPL job from TagPrinter 2.3 (print-to-file or debug log)
#   2. Paste the full SBPL here, replacing hard-coded field values with
#      the {variable} placeholders below.
#   3. Lines starting with # are stripped by sbpl_builder.py before sending.
#
# Available variables:
#   {rk_command}     — full <RK> NFC write command (computed, do not hardcode)
#   {flavor_number}  — e.g. 145
#   {flavor_name}    — e.g. Lemon Lime
#   {gtin}           — e.g. 00850010449708
#   {mfg_date}       — YYYY-MM-DD
#   {exp_date}       — YYYY-MM-DD
#   {copacker_id}    — e.g. 102089TX
#   {nfc_data}       — full pipe-delimited NFC payload string
#   {quantity}       — print quantity (integer)
#
# CURRENT STATUS: NFC-encode-only placeholder.
# Visual label commands (fonts, barcode, logo) will be added once a
# captured TagPrinter 2.3 SBPL job is provided.
<A>
{rk_command}
<Q>{quantity}
<Z>
